na Press Inc</publisher-name><fpage>233</fpage><lpage>262</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B20"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gundle</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Stewart</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Screen</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Beresford</surname><given-names>JN</given-names></name></person-group><person-group person-group-type="editor"><name><surname>Beresford J, Owen ME</surname></name></person-group><article-title>Isolation and culture of human bone-derived cells</article-title><source>Practical animal cell biology series: Marrow stromal cell culture</source><year>1998</year><publisher-name>Cambridge: Cambridge University Press</publisher-name><fpage>43</fpage><lpage>65</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B21"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Shigeno</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Ashton</surname><given-names>BA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Human bone-cell proliferation in vitro decreases with human donor age</article-title><source>J Bone Joint Surg Br</source><year>1995</year><volume>77</volume><fpage>139</fpage><lpage>42</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7822372</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B22"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Jost</surname><given-names>LM</given-names></name><name><surname>Kirkwood</surname><given-names>JM</given-names></name><name><surname>Whiteside</surname><given-names>TL</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Improved short- and long-term XTT-based colorimetric cellular cytotoxicity assay for melanoma and other tumor cells</article-title><source>Journal of immunological methods</source><year>1992</year><volume>147</volume><fpage>153</fpage><lpage>165</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1548398</pub-id></citation></re